-1 OCEANCITYMAP~
This is the map of Ocean City, created by Presto 11-27-94:
This area lies across the ocean north of Ofcol.
              _ _   _ _
     Land    | | | | | |
      of  <--   homes  |
      Not    |_|_| |_|_|
      _ _ _ _   _| |_   _ _ _ _
    _| | | | |_|     |_| | | | |
   |_ shops   _   *   _ guilds |        (-) Back
     |_| |_|_| |_   _| |_|_|_|_|
       | |  _____| |_____
           |    beach    |

{-}PRESTO
