#11402
guard cityguard~
An Ocean City Guard~
A guard of this city is keeping the peace.~
This guard is fairly tall, has a beard, and takes his job quite seriously.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
1000 S
35 0 0 10d39+450 10d3+10
1539 144081
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 50~
if quest(1,2,$n)==1
  shout $n the traitor is in the city!
  mpkill $n
~
>fight_prog 99~
if rand(15)
  cast "energy" $n
else
  if rand(15)
    cast "dispel evil" $n
  else
    if rand(25)
      cast "cure serious" $i
    else
      if rand(5)
        shout $n is a traitor of Ocean City!
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
#11403
guard gatekeeper~
The Gatekeeper~
The Gatekeeper of Ocean City is here.~
This gatekeeper seems extremely powerful.  It would be wise to ask him
the question "may I pass?".~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
-1000 S
65 0 0 50d80+10000 5d5+30
10000 415376
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
oload 11404 20
close gate
lock gate
mpat 11450 drop key
mpat 11450 sacrifice key
mpjunk key
~
>speech_prog p may I pass?~
say You may pass if you answer the following question.
say Are you a FRIEND or a FOE?
~
>rand_prog 10~
close gate
mpjunk key
~
>speech_prog friend~
mpmset $n quest 1 2 2
mpoload 11404 20
unlock gate
open gate
mpat 11904 drop key
say Welcome to our city.  Enjoy your stay.
~
>speech_prog foe~
say Wrong answer!  Prepare to die!
mpmset $n quest 1 2 1
mpkill $n
~
>death_prog 100~
mpoload 11404 20
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(1,2,$n) == 1
  shout Traitor!
  mpkill $n
endif
if quest(1,2,$n) == 2
  say Welcome $n, friend of Ocean City.
  mpoload 11404 20
  unlock gate
  open gate
  mpat 11904 drop key
endif
~
|
