>all_greet_prog 100~
tell $n Welcome, stranger.  May I help you?
~
>speech_prog yes~
if whichgod($n)==1
  tell $n You can death-set in the north-eastern-most residence.
else
  if whichgod($n)==2
    tell $n You can death-set in the south-western-most residence.
  else
    if actorhasobjnum(11408)
      tell $n You can set your death room in the city square.
    else
      tell $n Here, have a bible.
      mpoload 11408
      give bible $n
    endif
  endif
endif
~
